# ---------------------------------------------------------------- python ----
__pycache__/
*.py[cod]
*.egg-info/
.venv/
venv/

# ------------------------------------------------------------------ data ----
# 1.3 GB of cached market data: Binance klines, the 203 delisted-coin archive,
# and the Polymarket market cache. All of it is REGENERABLE - every fetch()
# rebuilds its own cache on first use - and GitHub rejects files over 100 MB.
# Keeping it out is what makes this repo cloneable onto a 1 GB VM.
strategy_analysis/data/

# ------------------------------------------------------------- run state ----
# Machine-specific. A VPS that cloned these would resume from THIS machine's
# open positions and single-instance locks, which is wrong in both directions.
logs/*_state.json
logs/*.pid
logs/*.tmp

# Log text is noisy and regenerates itself; the CSVs below are the actual record.
logs/*.log

# KEEP, explicitly - these are results, not artifacts:
!logs/trades_*.csv
!logs/poly_snapshots.csv

# ---------------------------------------------------------------- secrets ----
# Nothing here holds credentials today (Bitget keys come from environment
# variables and config.yaml carries only placeholders), and this list exists so
# that stays true by accident as well as by intent.
*.pem
*.key
*.ppk
.env
.env.*
secrets.yaml
credentials.json

# ------------------------------------------------------------------- os ----
Thumbs.db
.DS_Store
desktop.ini
